00:21:10,588 --> 00:21:16,588
The Walking Dead is an American zombie apocalypse media franchise centered on a
number of television series based on the comic book of the same name.

10
00:23:31,764 --> 00:23:37,764
Set in one fictional shared universe, the franchise has developed into seven live-action television series, eight
web series that tie into the first two television series, novels, video games, and other media.

11
00:25:52,941 --> 00:25:58,941
The television series all air on AMC and AMC+.

12
00:28:14,117 --> 00:28:20,117
The Walking Dead comic book was initially adapted into The
Walking Dead television series (2010–2022).

13
00:30:35,294 --> 00:30:41,294
It was followed by the spin-off series Fear the Walking Dead (2015–2023), The Walking Dead: World
Beyond (2020–2021), and the anthology series Tales of the Walking Dead (2022).

14
00:32:56,470 --> 00:33:02,470
Following the conclusion of the original television series, three further spin-off series have been released featuring returning main characters: The Walking Dead: Dead City (2023–present), which focuses
on Negan and Maggie; The Walking Dead: Daryl Dixon (2023–present), which focuses on Daryl and Carol; and The Walking Dead: The Ones Who Live (2024), which focuses on Rick and Michonne.

15
00:35:17,647 --> 00:35:23,647
Another series entitled More Tales from the Walking
Dead Universe is in development.

16
00:37:38,823 --> 00:37:44,823
The film explores themes of behind the scenes,
filmmaking, making of, documentary filmmaking.
